  "title": "Ubicloud Price Adjustment",
  "summary": "Since we set our prices in 2024, we saw a notable increase in our infrastructure costs. As a result, we’re increasing prices for most cloud services by 26%. New deployments will see this price increase on May 1, 2026. Existing resources will be charged at the new rate starting June 1, 2026.",
